# Real credential, gitignored and never committed — supplied to the
# container via docker-compose's bind mount (see docker-compose.yml),
# never baked into the image. Excluded here so a `COPY . .` can't
# accidentally embed it in an image layer even if it exists in the build
# context on someone's machine.
